  "description": "The command-line tool of DotNetSolutionKit: makes a solution, adds services and flags to it, describes a solution made with the template alone, and upgrades a solution to a newer version of the template, keeping your changes by a three-way merge.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "SawKing.DotsKit.Tool",
  "isPrerelease": false,
